    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736120/extras/948452907bbc813bc125496ac7b06899.webp?t=1680800527\" /></div><br><br>Alright, we can do this in two ways.<br> <br>We can tell you about a campaign that takes hours to plunder, 4-player co-op, dozens of guns, a myriad of attachments, skins, masks, deathmatch, tournament ladders, minigames, leaderboards, climbing, graffiti, hidden rewards, the GNOP, bossfights, free updates, dedicated customer support, and so on.<br> <br>Or, we can tell you what it\u2019s really about:<br> <br>Jaguar blood, gunpowder pheromone, treasure chest musk, gun oil bite, winning lottery ticket crumple, last bullet adrenaline, high fives, f*** yeahs, getting laid, burning rubber, superhero-landing on dust.<br>The world\u2019s about to end, and you can give it a final push. Rob a train, screw up, go on a grand adventure full of grit and juice, blow up the streets, earn a bounty on your head, and keep the engine running. <br><br><strong>Join Frank, Udo, Cody, and Kevin, four misfits out to get rich or kill anyone else trying.</strong><br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736120/extras/1402fa10d1d9c6763c8e61e652d04482.poster.avif?t=1680800527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736120/extras/1402fa10d1d9c6763c8e61e652d04482.webm?t=1680800527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1736120/extras/1402fa10d1d9c6763c8e61e652d04482.mp4?t=1680800527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Wishlist Gambit NOW!</strong>",
